1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,540
Writing, task two. E-mail number 2: Illness.

2
00:00:05,233 --> 00:00:15,348
You are ill and cannot come to work. Write an e-mail to your manager. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,033 --> 00:00:25,655
Dear Mr Dvořák,

4
00:00:25,967 --> 00:00:28,634
I am sorry, but I can't come to work today.

5
00:00:28,933 --> 00:00:31,198
I have a high temperature and a sore throat.

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,122
The doctor told me I must stay at home for a week.

7
00:00:34,433 --> 00:00:38,470
I will probably be back on Monday 10 February. My colleague Petr can do my work.

8
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:43,337
You can call me on 605 123 456.

9
00:00:43,633 --> 00:00:50,392
This e-mail has 53 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

10
00:00:51,100 --> 00:01:00,111
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
